  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程圖學",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING GRAPHICS",
    "describe_ch": "工程圖學為工程建設之基礎科學，舉凡土木工程、建築工程、運輸工程…等，皆需藉由工程圖學得到工程設計所需之圖說。本課程使學生瞭解製圖的原理及作業技術，並用AutoCAD軟體來製圖。",
    "describe_eh": "Engineering Graphics is the fundamental science to acquire necessary graphic scripts of engineering design for construction such as Civil Engineering, Architectural Engineering, Transportation Engineering, .etc. Students in this course will comprehend the theory of graphic making, operating techniques and are able to use AutoCAD application.",
    "pre_subname": "",
